  "content": [
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-stage-001",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Volumnia and Virgilia, mother and wife to Martius. They set them down on two low stools and sew."
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-001",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0001",
          "number": 1,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I pray you, daughter, sing, or express yourself in a more comfortable sort. If my son were my husband, I should freelier rejoice in that absence wherein he won honour than in the embracements of his bed where he would show most love. When yet he was but tender-bodied and the only son of my womb, when youth with comeliness plucked all gaze his way, when for a day of kings' entreaties a mother should not sell him an hour from her beholding, I, considering how honour would become such a person—that it was no better than picture-like to hang by th' wall, if renown made it not stir—was pleased to let him seek danger where he was like to find fame. To a cruel war I sent him, from whence he returned, his brows bound with oak. I tell thee, daughter, I sprang not more in joy at first hearing he was a man-child than now in first seeing he had proved himself a man.",
          "plainText": "I pray you daughter sing or express yourself in a more comfortable sort If my son were my husband I should freelier rejoice in that absence wherein he won honour than in the embracements of his bed where he would show most love When yet he was but tenderbodied and the only son of my womb when youth with comeliness plucked all gaze his way when for a day of kings' entreaties a mother should not sell him an hour from her beholding I considering how honour would become such a personthat it was no better than picturelike to hang by th' wall if renown made it not stirwas pleased to let him seek danger where he was like to find fame To a cruel war I sent him from whence he returned his brows bound with oak I tell thee daughter I sprang not more in joy at first hearing he was a manchild than now in first seeing he had proved himself a man",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-002",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0002",
          "number": 2,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "But had he died in the business, madam, how then?",
          "plainText": "But had he died in the business madam how then",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-003",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0003",
          "number": 3,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Then his good report should have been my son; I therein would have found issue. Hear me profess sincerely: had I a dozen sons, each in my love alike and none less dear than thine and my good Martius, I had rather had eleven die nobly for their country than one voluptuously surfeit out of action.",
          "plainText": "Then his good report should have been my son I therein would have found issue Hear me profess sincerely had I a dozen sons each in my love alike and none less dear than thine and my good Martius I had rather had eleven die nobly for their country than one voluptuously surfeit out of action",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-stage-002",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter a Gentlewoman."
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-004",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "gentlewoman",
        "name": "GENTLEWOMAN",
        "displayName": "Gentlewoman"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0004",
          "number": 4,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Madam, the Lady Valeria is come to visit you.",
          "plainText": "Madam the Lady Valeria is come to visit you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-005",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0005",
          "number": 5,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Beseech you, give me leave to retire myself.",
          "plainText": "Beseech you give me leave to retire myself",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-006",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0006",
          "number": 6,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Indeed you shall not.",
          "plainText": "Indeed you shall not",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0007",
          "number": 7,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Methinks I hear hither your husband's drum,",
          "plainText": "Methinks I hear hither your husband's drum",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0008",
          "number": 8,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "See him pluck Aufidius down by th' hair;",
          "plainText": "See him pluck Aufidius down by th' hair",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0009",
          "number": 9,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "As children from a bear, the Volsces shunning him.",
          "plainText": "As children from a bear the Volsces shunning him",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0010",
          "number": 10,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "Methinks I see him stamp thus and call thus:",
          "plainText": "Methinks I see him stamp thus and call thus",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0011",
          "number": 11,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "\"Come on, you cowards! You were got in fear,",
          "plainText": "Come on you cowards You were got in fear",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0012",
          "number": 12,
          "speechLineNumber": 7,
          "text": "Though you were born in Rome.\" His bloody brow",
          "plainText": "Though you were born in Rome His bloody brow",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0013",
          "number": 13,
          "speechLineNumber": 8,
          "text": "With his mailed hand then wiping, forth he goes",
          "plainText": "With his mailed hand then wiping forth he goes",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0014",
          "number": 14,
          "speechLineNumber": 9,
          "text": "Like to a harvestman that's tasked to mow",
          "plainText": "Like to a harvestman that's tasked to mow",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0015",
          "number": 15,
          "speechLineNumber": 10,
          "text": "Or all or lose his hire.",
          "plainText": "Or all or lose his hire",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-007",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0016",
          "number": 16,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "His bloody brow? O Jupiter, no blood!",
          "plainText": "His bloody brow O Jupiter no blood",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-008",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0017",
          "number": 17,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Away, you fool! It more becomes a man",
          "plainText": "Away you fool It more becomes a man",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0018",
          "number": 18,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "Than gilt his trophy. The breasts of Hecuba,",
          "plainText": "Than gilt his trophy The breasts of Hecuba",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0019",
          "number": 19,
          "speechLineNumber": 3,
          "text": "When she did suckle Hector, looked not lovelier",
          "plainText": "When she did suckle Hector looked not lovelier",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0020",
          "number": 20,
          "speechLineNumber": 4,
          "text": "Than Hector's forehead when it spit forth blood",
          "plainText": "Than Hector's forehead when it spit forth blood",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0021",
          "number": 21,
          "speechLineNumber": 5,
          "text": "At Grecian sword, contemning.—Tell Valeria",
          "plainText": "At Grecian sword contemningTell Valeria",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0022",
          "number": 22,
          "speechLineNumber": 6,
          "text": "We are fit to bid her welcome.",
          "plainText": "We are fit to bid her welcome",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-stage-003",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exit Gentlewoman.]"
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-009",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0023",
          "number": 23,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Heavens bless my lord from fell Aufidius!",
          "plainText": "Heavens bless my lord from fell Aufidius",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-010",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0024",
          "number": 24,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "He'll beat Aufidius' head below his knee",
          "plainText": "He'll beat Aufidius' head below his knee",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        },
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0025",
          "number": 25,
          "speechLineNumber": 2,
          "text": "And tread upon his neck.",
          "plainText": "And tread upon his neck",
          "lineType": "verse",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "multiple short line breaks"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-stage-004",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "Enter Valeria with an Usher and a Gentlewoman."
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-011",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0026",
          "number": 26,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "My ladies both, good day to you.",
          "plainText": "My ladies both good day to you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-012",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0027",
          "number": 27,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Sweet madam.",
          "plainText": "Sweet madam",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-013",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0028",
          "number": 28,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I am glad to see your Ladyship.",
          "plainText": "I am glad to see your Ladyship",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-014",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0029",
          "number": 29,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "How do you both? You are manifest housekeepers. What are you sewing here? A fine spot, in good faith. How does your little son?",
          "plainText": "How do you both You are manifest housekeepers What are you sewing here A fine spot in good faith How does your little son",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-015",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0030",
          "number": 30,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I thank your Ladyship; well, good madam.",
          "plainText": "I thank your Ladyship well good madam",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-016",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0031",
          "number": 31,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "He had rather see the swords and hear a drum than look upon his schoolmaster.",
          "plainText": "He had rather see the swords and hear a drum than look upon his schoolmaster",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-017",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0032",
          "number": 32,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O' my word, the father's son! I'll swear 'tis a very pretty boy. O' my troth, I looked upon him o' Wednesday half an hour together. H'as such a confirmed countenance. I saw him run after a gilded butterfly, and when he caught it, he let it go again, and after it again, and over and over he comes, and up again, catched it again. Or whether his fall enraged him or how 'twas, he did so set his teeth and tear it. O, I warrant how he mammocked it!",
          "plainText": "O' my word the father's son I'll swear 'tis a very pretty boy O' my troth I looked upon him o' Wednesday half an hour together H'as such a confirmed countenance I saw him run after a gilded butterfly and when he caught it he let it go again and after it again and over and over he comes and up again catched it again Or whether his fall enraged him or how 'twas he did so set his teeth and tear it O I warrant how he mammocked it",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-018",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0033",
          "number": 33,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "One on's father's moods.",
          "plainText": "One on's father's moods",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-019",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0034",
          "number": 34,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Indeed, la, 'tis a noble child.",
          "plainText": "Indeed la 'tis a noble child",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-020",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0035",
          "number": 35,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "A crack, madam.",
          "plainText": "A crack madam",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-021",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0036",
          "number": 36,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Come, lay aside your stitchery. I must have you play the idle huswife with me this afternoon.",
          "plainText": "Come lay aside your stitchery I must have you play the idle huswife with me this afternoon",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-022",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0037",
          "number": 37,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No, good madam, I will not out of doors.",
          "plainText": "No good madam I will not out of doors",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-023",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0038",
          "number": 38,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Not out of doors?",
          "plainText": "Not out of doors",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-024",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0039",
          "number": 39,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "She shall, she shall.",
          "plainText": "She shall she shall",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-025",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0040",
          "number": 40,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Indeed, no, by your patience. I'll not over the threshold till my lord return from the wars.",
          "plainText": "Indeed no by your patience I'll not over the threshold till my lord return from the wars",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-026",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0041",
          "number": 41,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Fie, you confine yourself most unreasonably. Come, you must go visit the good lady that lies in.",
          "plainText": "Fie you confine yourself most unreasonably Come you must go visit the good lady that lies in",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-027",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0042",
          "number": 42,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "I will wish her speedy strength and visit her with my prayers, but I cannot go thither.",
          "plainText": "I will wish her speedy strength and visit her with my prayers but I cannot go thither",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-028",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0043",
          "number": 43,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Why, I pray you?",
          "plainText": "Why I pray you",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-029",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0044",
          "number": 44,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "'Tis not to save labour, nor that I want love.",
          "plainText": "'Tis not to save labour nor that I want love",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-030",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0045",
          "number": 45,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "You would be another Penelope. Yet they say all the yarn she spun in Ulysses' absence did but fill Ithaca full of moths. Come, I would your cambric were sensible as your finger, that you might leave pricking it for pity. Come, you shall go with us.",
          "plainText": "You would be another Penelope Yet they say all the yarn she spun in Ulysses' absence did but fill Ithaca full of moths Come I would your cambric were sensible as your finger that you might leave pricking it for pity Come you shall go with us",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-031",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0046",
          "number": 46,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No, good madam, pardon me; indeed, I will not forth.",
          "plainText": "No good madam pardon me indeed I will not forth",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-032",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0047",
          "number": 47,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "In truth, la, go with me, and I'll tell you excellent news of your husband.",
          "plainText": "In truth la go with me and I'll tell you excellent news of your husband",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-033",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0048",
          "number": 48,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "O, good madam, there can be none yet.",
          "plainText": "O good madam there can be none yet",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-034",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0049",
          "number": 49,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Verily, I do not jest with you. There came news from him last night.",
          "plainText": "Verily I do not jest with you There came news from him last night",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-035",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0050",
          "number": 50,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Indeed, madam!",
          "plainText": "Indeed madam",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-036",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0051",
          "number": 51,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "In earnest, it's true. I heard a senator speak it. Thus it is: the Volsces have an army forth, against whom Cominius the General is gone with one part of our Roman power. Your lord and Titus Lartius are set down before their city Corioles. They nothing doubt prevailing, and to make it brief wars. This is true, on mine honour, and so, I pray, go with us.",
          "plainText": "In earnest it's true I heard a senator speak it Thus it is the Volsces have an army forth against whom Cominius the General is gone with one part of our Roman power Your lord and Titus Lartius are set down before their city Corioles They nothing doubt prevailing and to make it brief wars This is true on mine honour and so I pray go with us",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-037",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0052",
          "number": 52,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Give me excuse, good madam. I will obey you in everything hereafter.",
          "plainText": "Give me excuse good madam I will obey you in everything hereafter",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-038",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "volumnia",
        "name": "VOLUMNIA",
        "displayName": "Volumnia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0053",
          "number": 53,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Let her alone, lady. As she is now, she will but disease our better mirth.",
          "plainText": "Let her alone lady As she is now she will but disease our better mirth",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-039",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0054",
          "number": 54,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "In troth, I think she would.—Fare you well, then.—Come, good sweet lady.—Prithee, Virgilia, turn thy solemness out o' door, and go along with us.",
          "plainText": "In troth I think she wouldFare you well thenCome good sweet ladyPrithee Virgilia turn thy solemness out o' door and go along with us",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-040",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "virgilia",
        "name": "VIRGILIA",
        "displayName": "Virgilia"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0055",
          "number": 55,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "No, at a word, madam. Indeed I must not. I wish you much mirth.",
          "plainText": "No at a word madam Indeed I must not I wish you much mirth",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-speech-041",
      "type": "speech",
      "speaker": {
        "id": "valeria",
        "name": "VALERIA",
        "displayName": "Valeria"
      },
      "lines": [
        {
          "id": "coriolanus-1-3-line-0056",
          "number": 56,
          "speechLineNumber": 1,
          "text": "Well then, farewell.",
          "plainText": "Well then farewell",
          "lineType": "prose",
          "lineTypeDetection": "auto",
          "lineTypeConfidence": "medium",
          "lineTypeReason": "single-line speech block"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "coriolanus-1-3-stage-005",
      "type": "stage",
      "text": "[Exeunt.]"
    }
  ]
}